  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ending Violence against Women and Girls - Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to strengthen mechanisms to tackle VAWG across the whole continuum from prevention and protection to response. Primary and secondary VAWG prevention is a key objective. In Tanzania Kivulini will continue to implement the SASA! program in Mwanza region to educate people to use their power positively to sustain change at an individual and community level. .</narrative>
  </description>
